sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as Developer
    participant GH as GitHub
    participant CI as CI Workflow (Moon)
    participant CD as CD Workflow
    participant DH as Docker Hub
    participant YQ as yq Tool
    participant Cluster as Docker Swarm Cluster

    Dev->>GH: Create Pull Request (to development/staging/main)
    activate CI
    GH->>CI: Trigger ci-service-tests.yml
    CI->>CI: moon run service:test
    CI->>CI: moon run service:docker-build

    alt Tests Pass
        CI->>GH: Tests Passed
        deactivate CI
        Dev->>GH: Merge Pull Request

        alt Merged to staging or main
            GH->>GH: Create Tag (X.XX-rc for staging / X.XX for main)
            GH->>CD: Trigger cd-env-master.yml
            activate CD
            CD->>CD: Build Docker Images
            CD->>DH: Push images with new tags
            DH-->>CD: Images uploaded
            CD->>YQ: Update docker-stack.yml
            YQ->>YQ: Modify image tags
            CD->>GH: Commit updated docker-stack.yml
            GH->>CD: Detect docker-stack.yml changes
            CD->>CD: Trigger cd-env.yml
            CD->>Cluster: SSH Connection
            CD->>Cluster: docker stack deploy
            Cluster->>Cluster: Compare with current state
            Cluster->>Cluster: Update only changed services
            Cluster-->>CD: Deployment complete
            CD->>GH: Deployment successful
            deactivate CD
        else Merged to development
            note over GH: No tag created, no CD triggered.
        end
    else Tests Fail
        CI->>GH: Tests Failed
        GH->>Dev: Review required
    end
